{"version":1,"content":"<p>【反抗無效 😱】這幾天接連爆出堪稱「核彈級」的高危漏洞，整個 IT 與網管界幾乎都要通宵修補。</p><p>OpenAI 行政總裁 Sam Altman 坦言，現今 AI 模型的逆向分析與漏洞挖掘能力，已徹底打破傳統人類黑客的威脅模型，資訊保安團隊未來將無法修補所有的安全漏洞，傳統以「修補程式」為主的數碼防護時代已經終結。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T07:23:54.440129+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":156,"images":0,"source":"HKEPC","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T07:17:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T21:38:08.340426+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T07:18:03.676506+00:00","content_hash":"83b95af529bb5e8a3b57466f2bd8aac4306da79046c5afb3dfc525496c61c6d6","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}